Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Y
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You four are absolutely pathetic.\NYou lost your duels, so you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,decided to just take what you\Nwanted by force which is something i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,won't tolerate is that clear i\Nhired you fools to duel for me so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.63,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,by losing and then cheating you\Nmake me look weak let us explain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, we understand that\Nyou have laws, but we must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,from this place and to do that we\Nneed bodies you already have one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,that tristan kid one won't do\Nsir we need five bodies so we can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,all escape greetings i just came\Nto say farewell before i go now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that i have a body of my own\Ni'm ready to escape to the real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,world technically my robots and i\Nare the only ones that want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So Tristan's body belongs to me now.\NA deal's a deal, right, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you lost that door crump is right\Nthose kids defeated you nesbit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,therefore that body isn't your\Nproperty you're guilty of seizing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,control of somebody else's personal\Npossession not quite i'm the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,one calling all the shots here\Nso i'll decide what's wrong and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,right so can i go not yet i have\Na much better idea so listen up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All five of you will share Tristan's body\Nin a duel against Seto's strongest rival,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat him, and I'll prove\Nonce and for all that I deserve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Control of Seto's empire,\Nand you'll get five bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't fail you, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds of us supporting\Nyou are zero percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir. Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Noah's your stepbrother, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But it does explain why\NNoah brought us all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he wants to prove to Kaiba's\Nstepdad that he's the better son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So to show his power, Noah teamed\Nup with the Big Five to defeat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's holding Mokuba\Ncaptive to weaken Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.35,0:03:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, then that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you, geeks, this is family\Nbusiness, and it doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you're wrong, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let him go, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be too concerned with\Nyourself to realize this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but because of your family\Nbusiness, we're all trapped here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize we can\Nhelp you save Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me when I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba is our friend\Nand we want to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you worry about him instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Tristan, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the techno geek of\Nthe Big Five, Nesbitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he kicked his nerdy butt in\Nthat duel, he still took Tristan's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone in here. Today's\Nspecial is five for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the verdict is in Our\Ncombined force will destroy you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.59,0:04:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all using Tristan's body.\NGive him back. Listen, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one way\Nwe'll return your friend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But believe me, Junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the odds are in our favor Hey,\Nthat's grump, sicko All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,tell us what we have to do to get\NTristan back from your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, duel us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Win and he's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about returning the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We never discussed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:05:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who won this\Nbody, and I won't give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nesbit, it belongs to all of us\Nnow, and this was a group decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you two are actually\Narguing as if we're going to keep our word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's duel, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You five are on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this for Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your math's a little\Noff if you get my drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Five-on-one's uneven, so\Ncount me in. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us are a team, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's waste these five suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and together we'll save Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Five on two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan was to duel Yugi alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you all realize that that\Ninferior duelist, Joseph Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,will only hold Yugi back, making\Nthis an open and shut case for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, that inferior\Nduelist defeated you, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit back and observe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.09,0:06:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lector, because I'm about to hit\Nthem with a legal technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, since this duel is\Ntwo bodies against one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way for justice to\Nbe served is for us to start
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,with 8,000 life points while\Nyou two begin with 4,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Win and you'll be\Nreunited with your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose and you all belong to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two ready to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, because you're\Nfighting the dream team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You five are going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose your virtual decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need all the help you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai loves that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your trip to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we get out of this virtual\Ndump, I'm going to rescue Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now I'll pick her Cyber\NHobby for good luck. Now it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to choose your jet master. I\Nchoose this monster Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take Blame Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,since there's five of us\Nwe're going to rotate our
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Deck Master monsters,\Nso I'll start with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,my deep sea warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A strong investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stand back, I'll begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first, I'll play this\Nmagic card, a legendary ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to flood the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:08:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll summon this\Nmonster, the legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the card Mako\NTsunami almost beat me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to sacrifice something\Nfirst to play that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too powerful to summon to\Nthe field in your first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With his magic card he can. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary ocean changes my\Nfive-star monsters to four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this simple fact\Nallows me to summon them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,directly to the field without\Nsacrificing another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as that card is in play,\Nhe's at a dangerous advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll dry up his ocean in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll sink long before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You take the next move, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, these corporate\Ntycoons can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are gonna put these\Nguys out of business, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all gonna start\Nright now. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon alligator's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.89,0:09:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for now, you old geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't get used to that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if that metal\Nchimp's Tristan or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna reunite him\Nwith his body no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I summon Gazelle, the King of\NMythical Beasts, in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try, Gansley, because all the\Nnumbers seem to point in my favor right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Crumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that I'm busy\Ncrushing the competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be a fool not to let me\Ntake charge of this duel now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget the special\Nability of my Nightmare Penguin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,His voice changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they've switched control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Crump, the Big Five's accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm an expert in crunching\Nnumbers and crushing my rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now meet my good friend,\NNightmare Penguin,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the last Deckmaster you two will ever see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush this bird brain I already beat this\Nflipper-footed freak and so can you These
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,kids don't realize that the countdown to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,their destruction has\Nbegun and with me doing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the counting They'll be out of life points
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,before they can say Antarctic Annihilation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,for my deck master special ability raises
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the attack points of\Nall underwater monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes legendary fishermen\Nattack Yugi's mythical beasts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the special ability\Nof my Nightmare Penguin,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,my fisherman gets a\N200 attack point bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about the numbers, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And your number's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I summon Catapult Turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He played another five-star monster,\Nand thanks to that magic card of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,he didn't have to make\Na sacrifice! Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get rid of his\Nlegendary ocean card
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,or we can say goodbye\Nto our bodies forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and his friends can\Ndeal with the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got bigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozaburo Kaiba only had one son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That was me, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's story has to be a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims that the man who\Nadopted me is his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But based on his story, that would\Nmake Noah the same age as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's clearly just a\Nsnot-nosed little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the Big Five\Nput that kid up to all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Those corporate slime balls would\Ndo anything to take over Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're too dim-witted to\Ncome up with a scheme like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a piece to this virtual\Npuzzle that I still need to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, all of this\Nnonsense will be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But the first thing I\Nhave to do is find Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And rescue him from Noah's\Ncontrol before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,little punk completely\Nbrainwashes my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll show Noah that no one disrespects\Nmy family and gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Big Five, you body snatchers\Nbetter give back my friend. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my kunai with chain trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's definitely a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use this little baby to reel\Nin his legendary fisherman hook,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,line, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your big move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I summon Cyber Harpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I switch Alligator's\Nsword into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:12:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And that ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And starts mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to pick\Nup where Joey left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything in my hand that can
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,stop his legendary\Nfisherman from attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's face-down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be my only hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I summon Mystical\NElf in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what you can do, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've dueled for long enough, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnson, the odds are still in my favor,\Nso stay out of this until I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, say goodbye to your mystical elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.79,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary fisherman, destroy Yugi's\Nmonster with Harpoon of Doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.61,0:13:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunai with change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent move, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quite a long face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're upset just because\Nyour fisherman got a little tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my chain, he can't attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,while my cyber hobby\Ngets even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And things were going\Nso good for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you five freaks\Nknow who you're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let them do this,\NCrump? Step aside. You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran the numbers and I still have\Na high percentage for victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll conclude by placing one\Nmonster face down in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And that ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, Tristan will have his body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good start, but\Nthis duel's far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I thought we'd turn\Nthat monkey switch off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So if that's really you\Nstuck inside there, Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,then why do you keep making all\Nkinds of weird monkey noises?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, monkey noises?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be going ape!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer I stay in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the more I feel like swinging from\Na tree and scratching my armpits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get my body back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again, Crump!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to dry\Nup your ocean, Crump!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,With yet another card,\Ncompliments him is my valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I activate my\NHarpy's Feather Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This card sweeps away every magic and\Ntrap card on your side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,including your legendary ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.17,0:15:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Cyber Harpy, attack\Nhis legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator's sword, attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Catapult Turtles still\Nhas 2,000 defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:16:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack won't do a thing. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still my move, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not done wiping the field clean\Nof all your pathetic monsters yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And my next victim is that\Nface-down mystery monster of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey. Don't. It's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Risk is my middle name, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator's Sword, attack\Nhis face-down monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You just triggered my Magician\Nof Faith special effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can bring back one magic card. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one guess\Nwhich card I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's up. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools are making this way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're defeating yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my Legendary Ocean\NMagic card is back in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can activate it in my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play Monster Reborn and\Nbring back my Legendary Fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It all adds up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back where I was\Nbefore, on the road to freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,with a brand new body to escape in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My chances of success are 99%.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's about time someone put\Nyou in your place. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play Karibo in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate card\Ndestruction. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we must throw away all our cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,which means your legendary ocean\Ncard is gone again. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I could count on you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for all of us to\Nredraw a brand new hand, right, Crump?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to lay a little\Njudgment on these fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Crump has been dismissed, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They switched again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Those old dudes are passing around\Nmy body like it's going out of style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.19,0:18:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why they're winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.99,0:18:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, this duel is beginning\Nto take its toll on Yugi and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Big Five keep rotating\Nplayers to keep themselves fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to bring you to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you don't already know, the name's\NJohnson, legal expert of the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And my first order of business is\Nto clear the field of this penguin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Judge-Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:18:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like your so-called\Nbrother is calling for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to answer him, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah is the only brother I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This Noah kid is trying my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If he has some sort of grudge against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,he should have the guts to\Nstand up to me face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But capturing my defenseless\Nbrother and hiding him in this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual labyrinth only shows what\Na spineless coward Noah really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.85,0:19:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it can't be. That building.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my design.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never shown those\Nblueprints to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Noah have recreated it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, he's a baby.
